OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA chillier
OL,6,Fnight to come, especially under
OL,7,Fclearer skies with light winds.
OL,8,FCloudier with a risk of the odd shower
OL,9,Falong Devon and Cornwall coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA chilly start to Saturday
OL,12,Fwith patchy frost, but prolonged sunny
OL,13,Fspells through the day. Breezier along
OL,14,Fexposed coastlines, with temperatures
OL,15,Fnear the average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
