OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FRemaining chilly, particularly in the
OL,7,Fwest on Sunday morning, but plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine on offer later. Turning
OL,9,Fcloudier with some welcome rain
OL,10,Fthrough Monday and Tuesday. Breezy
OL,11,Falong southern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
